WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.350
Jamie jumps from the recorded midscreen spacing.

2
00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:02.050
The first OD dive launches Ryu.

3
00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:02.750
The raw-Rush launcher carries the juggle forward.

4
00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:03.100
Jumping medium kick continues the air chain.

5
00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:03.800
A second OD dive sends Ryu toward the floor.

6
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:06.950
Jamie spends one Super stock after the second dive.

7
00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:08.300
Level 1 continues the carried juggle.

8
00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:10.200
Ryu lands farther toward the right side after the Super.
